  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Strengthening conflict &amp; situational awareness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action will support UN-led efforts in the area of conflict and situational awareness in Libya. The provision of geospatial services to the United Nations Support Mission in Libya (UNSMIL) will assist the Mission in monitoring critical aspects of the 2020 Ceasefire Agreement implementation. Moreover, the provision of high-resolution satellite imagery, evidence-based reporting and documentation will strengthen UNSMIL&#xbf;s and the EU delegation&#xbf;s situational awareness, analysis and understanding of complex conflict dynamics in Libya, inform UN leadership&#xbf;s good offices towards conflict prevention and contribute to preserving the safety and security of personnel and premises in times of crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
